{
  "_comment": "Track B baseline: V4 dual-path + ConvLastTSBackbone (default last-timestep) + calibrated loss. y_1800 horizon, input_len=1200. Establishes y_1800 V4 baseline for backbone A/B/C comparison. Same calibration losses as y_600 Track A (validated). [Hotfix 2026-04-27: include_ridge_features=false to match depth-only NPZ. Rebuild NPZ + flip flag to true once trades synced for full 64-feat parity with y_180/y_600 V4.]",
